{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "act23side_level_act23side_st03",
  "groupId": "act23side",
  "stageId": "act23side_st03",
  "title": "Keep the Ploy",
  "storyCode": "WB-ST-3",
  "avgTag": "Interlude",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/activities/act23side/level_act23side_st03.txt",
  "sourceHash": "437c1dbdf16ab0e74c2ab85652596d9a4891b7713d87423f8794e880fd3335a1",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "How is Mr. Lin doing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The doctor says he'll be fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It's just that his old injuries and overuse of Arts have taken a toll on him."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Dad is getting old, after all."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Sometimes I forget how long Mr. Lin has served Lungmen."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Dad is not like Chief Wei. As the symbol of Lungmen, Chief Wei always stays in the public eye."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But Lungmen doesn't exactly want everyone remembering that there is a Rat King of Downtown."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I heard Wei Yenwu dragged you into this."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It became my business when I chose to accept it, of my own accord."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "And it all turned out fine, thanks to a certain someone."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Tsk."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "This incident also helped me answer a couple of questions."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Are you going to Victoria? We could travel together."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "No, my plans have changed."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'm going back to Lungmen."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What do you mean by 'going back to Lungmen?'"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'm staying."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Throwing off your burdens sounds nice, but whatever you throw off, somebody else has to pick up."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Whether one leaves or stays is up to oneself, but someone has to take care of Lungmen."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Mm..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I said that for me, but feel free to take it as a criticism, if you want."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Glad to see you still have the strength to joke."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The daughter of the Rat King doesn't have to be the Rat King, but it doesn't mean she can't be."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "She could be a different sort of Rat King."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "This time, I made my own choice."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "There are slums in Lungmen, but there shouldn't be. It's a job that someone has to do, no matter how many years go by."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The times are changing, but no one should be left behind."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I believe that, when it's you saying it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "By the way..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What is it? Your turn to hem and haw?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Have you seen Wei Yenwu these past few days?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wei Yenwu",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Are you leaving, Grandmaster?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chongyue",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Yes."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chongyue",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Once I've handed over my duties."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chongyue",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Speaking of which, I must thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wei Yenwu",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "For what?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chongyue",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You chose to trust Yumen."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chongyue",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "And you chose to trust my friends."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wei Yenwu",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It's all water under the bridge."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wei Yenwu",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We suffered some losses, but we should count ourselves fortunate that the situation remained under control."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chongyue",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "More importantly, I saw how the people here remain united, even after so many years."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chongyue",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Yumen hasn't changed. Man will triumph over Heaven."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chongyue",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Now I can be at ease about leaving."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wei Yenwu",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wei Yenwu",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "There's no telling when we'll meet again."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wei Yenwu",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Take care, Grandmaster."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chongyue",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You too. Beware the intrigue of the court."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wei Yenwu",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I will."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wei Yenwu",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "By the way, you said something about Ch'en's swordsmanship yesterday."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wei Yenwu",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "'Skillful, but not yet the peak of perfection.'"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chongyue",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Yes, I remember."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wei Yenwu",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Ch'en has talent, but she only just started learning the Chi Xiao style recently."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wei Yenwu",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "She has not mastered its true essence."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chongyue",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Ah, you wanted to show off your skills."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wei Yenwu",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I said before that Cloud-splitting sword is not actually Chi Xiao's ultimate move."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "His fingers are his sword.\nA light breeze begins blowing out of nowhere, creating tiny ripples in the teacup."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wei Yenwu",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The ultimate move of Chi Xiao, Heaven's Eye."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chongyue",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The form?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wei Yenwu",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The eye of Heaven sees all and nothing."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chongyue",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The concept?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wei Yenwu",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Only when the clouds are parted is Heaven's wrathful eye revealed."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wei Yenwu",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "One must free one's mind to learn the form."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chongyue",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The obstacle?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wei Yenwu",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Let your heart guide the sword, never looking back."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wei Yenwu",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Turn around, and the sword loses its sharpness, harming the user."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wei Yenwu",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Farewell."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The breeze continues to blow, long after the chair is empty.\nThe man gazes into the ripples in the teacup, until a smile appears on his face."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chongyue",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I have never seen the likes of it."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grand Tutor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Come in."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shadow Guard",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Grand Tutor."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grand Tutor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You understand that entering Yumen without permission is enough to carry the suspicion of treason on its own?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shadow Guard",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Yes."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shadow Guard",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Lord Wei was attacked, and trapped in Yumen, while Yumen travels towards the capital..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shadow Guard",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We were concerned for Lord Wei's safety. The urgency of the situation did not allow for deliberation."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shadow Guard",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We have nothing but our lives to repay Lord Wei's kindness."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grand Tutor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Did Wei Yenwu tell you to look for him in Yumen if he did not return in three days?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shadow Guard",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "That is so."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grand Tutor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I can tell you now that both the assassination attempt on Wei Yenwu and the crisis at Yumen were accidents. There is no need to worry."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shadow Guard",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I understand."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grand Tutor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Where were you when the Catastrophe happened?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shadow Guard",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We operated in secret, eliminating insurgents stealthily."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grand Tutor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "At least you did one thing you were supposed to."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grand Tutor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You may go."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shadow Guard",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We are not subject to the Grand Tutor's punishment?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grand Tutor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "As far as the Imperial Guard is concerned, all of you are already dead."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grand Tutor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I never saw you today."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shadow Guard",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Yes, Grand Tutor."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wei Yenwu",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You knew."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grand Tutor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "From the beginning."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grand Tutor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "And you never had any intention of hiding it from me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wei Yenwu",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Do you not reproach me for overstepping my boundaries?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grand Tutor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The situation remained under control thanks to the young envoy that you brought from Lungmen."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wei Yenwu",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The Grand Commandant will soon learn of this incident."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grand Tutor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "'Soon' is not the word I would use."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wei Yenwu",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "This is why I came to Yumen."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wei Yenwu",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "There is no consensus on how we should deal with the bestial Sui, whether we should prepare for war, or reconciliation. It is hard to see the forest when one is amongst the trees."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wei Yenwu",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The minds of some of the parties concerned may no longer be on finding the right answer."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grand Tutor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You wanted to help the Lord Exorcist eliminate the insurgents out of a sense of duty to Yan."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grand Tutor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "As long as you don't lose sight of it, you won't need me to tell you what to do."
    },
    {
